									<ul><li class="s6">To develop integrated townships with world-class infrastructure, ensuring a sustainable and prosperous future.</li><li class="s6">To provide modern commercial and residential spaces that meet evolving lifestyle and business needs.</li><li class="s6">To incorporate eco-friendly and smart urban planning for a greener, cleaner environment.</li></ul>								</div>
