				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-8b0ab01 underline-heading-black elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="8b0ab01" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInDown&quot;}" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Project Overview</h2>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-99b1f3d elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="99b1f3d" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInDown&quot;}" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Our First Landmark Project</h2>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2992738 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget-mobile__width-inherit elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="2992738" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInRight&quot;}" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p><strong><b> </b></strong>We are proud to launch our flagship town in Haveli Lakha – Waswewala, District Okara, Punjab, Pakistan. This state-of-the-art town will offer all essential amenities, including modern housing, commercial centers, green spaces, healthcare, and education facilities.</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-dc1f377 elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-button" data-id="dc1f377" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInRight&quot;}" data-widget_type="button.default">
										<a class="elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm elementor-animation-float" href="https://sutlejdevelopments.com/about-us/">
						<span class="elementor-button-content-wrapper">
						<span class="elementor-button-icon">
				<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="23" viewBox="0 0 22 23" fill="none"><g clip-path="url(#clip0_11_340)"><g clip-path="url(#clip1_11_340)"><path d="M10.9999 0.857422C10.9999 1.8147 11.9486 3.24718 12.9076 4.4502C14.1425 5.9991 15.6164 7.35218 17.3075 8.38528C18.5744 9.15885 20.1129 9.90143 21.3488 9.90143M10.9999 18.9678C10.9999 18.0105 11.9486 16.5781 12.9076 15.3751C14.1425 13.8262 15.6164 12.4731 17.3075 11.44C18.5744 10.6664 20.1129 9.9238 21.3488 9.9238M21.3488 9.91262H0.651123" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.375"></path></g></g><defs><clipPath id="clip0_11_340"><rect width="22" height="22" fill="white" transform="translate(0 0.287598)"></rect></clipPath><clipPath id="clip1_11_340"><rect width="22" height="19.25" fill="white" transform="translate(0 0.287598)"></rect></clipPath></defs></svg>			</span>
									<span class="elementor-button-text">Read More  </span>
					</span>
					</a>
								</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-c875d87 e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-parent" data-id="c875d87" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-cfd991d e-con-full e-flex wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-child" data-id="cfd991d" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-ee91b69 elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="ee91b69" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInLeft&quot;}" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Beyond Development: Our Commitment to Sustainability</h2>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-f71d068 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget-mobile__width-inherit elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="f71d068" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInRight&quot;}" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>As part of our Corporate Social Responsibility (CSR), we have founded Pure Planet, an NGO dedicated to recycling solid waste and promoting environmental awareness. By transforming waste into usable products, we reinvest in educating communities on sanitation and waste management, ensuring a cleaner and more sustainable future.</p>								</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-0c37734 e-con-full e-flex wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-child" data-id="0c37734" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-9afc735 elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="9afc735" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInLeft&quot;}" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Why Choose Sutlej Developments?</h2>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-d8a1d5b elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget-mobile__width-inherit elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="d8a1d5b" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInRight&quot;}" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>✔ Innovative &amp; Sustainable Urban Planning<br />✔ High-Quality Infrastructure &amp; Modern Amenities<br />✔ Commitment to Environmental &amp; Social Responsibility<br />✔ Customer-Centric Approach &amp; Long-Term Value<br />At Sutlej Developments, we are not just constructing buildings—we are creating thriving, well-connected communities where people can live, work, and prosper.<br />Join us in shaping the future. 🚀🏡🌿</p>								</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-7cc1e48 e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-parent" data-id="7cc1e48" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-a1bfd35 e-con-full e-flex wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-child" data-id="a1bfd35" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-c2d5b17 underline-heading-black elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="c2d5b17" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInDown&quot;}" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Project Overview</h2>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-cb93b99 elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="cb93b99" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInLeft&quot;}" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Sutlej Town</h2>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2bffc28 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget-mobile__width-inherit elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="2bffc28" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInRight&quot;}" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<section id="overview"><div class="section-content"><p>Our first town project is strategically located in Haveli Lakha, a city in Depalpur Tehsil of Okara District, approximately 158 kilometers southwest of Lahore. This location offers a blend of cultural heritage and accessibility, making it an ideal setting for a contemporary town.​ </p></div></section><section id="features"></section>								</div>
				</div>
